Studies of potential therapies began in January 2020, and at the moment several antiviral drugs are in clinical trials.
Remdesivir seems the most promising.
The development of new medicinal products can last until 2021, but some of the tested drugs have already been approved for other purposes or are in the final stages of testing.
Antiviral drugs can be tested in patients with severe forms of the disease.
